              <h2
                class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-wd-950 dark:text-gray-50 sm:text-6xl"
              >
                Bringt den Professionellen Service zu euch
              </h2>
              <p
                class="relative mt-6 text-lg leading-8 text-wd-600 dark:text-gray-200 sm:max-w-md lg:max-w-none"
              >
                Qualität im Service von Anfang an
              </p>
              <ul
                role="list"
                class="mt-8 max-w-xl space-y-8 text-wd-700 dark:text-wd-50"
              >
                <li class="flex gap-x-3">
                  <svg
                    class="mt-1 h-5 w-5 flex-none text-wd-600 dark:text-wd-400"
                    viewBox="0 0 20 20"
                    fill="currentColor"
                    aria-hidden="true"
                  >
                    <path
                      fill-rule="evenodd"
                      d="M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.857-9.809a.75.75 0 00-1.214-.882l-3.483 4.79-1.88-1.88a.75.75 0 10-1.06 1.061l2.5 2.5a.75.75 0 001.137-.089l4-5.5z"
                      clip-rule="evenodd"></path>
                  </svg>
                  <span
                    ><strong class="font-semibold text-wd-950 dark:text-white"
                      >Hohe Qualität.</strong
